The Object.assign cannot be removed. 

If you call `assignWithDepth(..,.., { depth: 2 })`, clobber will be undefined now. 


This is something else you can do. 
```suggestion
  {depth = 2, clobber = false}: { depth: number; clobber: boolean } = {}
): any => {
  const config = { depth, clobber };
```
